:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]], see [[Head Rococo (Enemy)]].''
'''Holy Phoenix''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. In the same update, his [[True Form]] increases his health, damage, range, speed, deploy cost, recharge time, chance to freeze and becomes strong against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.6 Update#Version 13.6.1|Version 13.6.1]].

